        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 / 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any VR capable graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Works with Steam VR and the following standalone headsets: Quest 1/2/Pro, Pico 4/Neo 3, Vive Focus 3/XR Elite, YVR 1/2</li></ul>",
